; range_empty_skip: RANGE with count = 0 skips its body. This is the
; behaviour ITER is required to match; the pair is here so a future change
; to either opener has to move both.

PUSH 0
STOW r1

PUSH 0           ; start
PUSH 0           ; count
RANGE
LOAD r1
INC
STOW r1
NEXT

PUSH 0
OUTPUT r1
HALT
